{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415043","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415043","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041504301:1":{"text":"Looks like you've been faring well lately.","source_cn":"看起来你最近过得不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F38C75C7339BC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504302:1":{"text":"Tch! Don't pretend you haven't been lurking around, watching me!","source_cn":"啧！我就知道人群中盯着我的熟悉视线是你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B51DE5C3543EFEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504303:1":{"text":"Why do you do that? It's annoying!","source_cn":"为什么一直盯着我？烦不烦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE4535F40D60452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504304:1":{"text":"Heh. You said the same thing after the captain pulled you out of the depths.","source_cn":"你刚从海里被船长捞上来的时候，也说了这句话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BED9651824C6BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504305:1":{"text":"Enough! Don't dredge up the past!","source_cn":"够了，别和我提以前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB912EA0022402B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504306:1":{"text":"I told you, I don't need you in my way. And don't start with the whole sisterly act!","source_cn":"我还说过别靠近我，我不想叫你姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A3F8084EF26408","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504307:1":{"text":"Keep staring, and I'll just have to take those eyes of yours.","source_cn":"再盯着我，我也不管这里是不是别人的地盘了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452F9388577E7BBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504308:1":{"text":"Captain's got no chains on me anymore—I can do whatever I like!","source_cn":"反正现在船长也管不了我，我想干什么，就可以干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB464E7B6F1D2C8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504309:1":{"text":"In fact... I've had my sights on your eyes for a while now. Hahaha!","source_cn":"你的眼珠子，我想要很久了哈哈哈……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x794C3D0238F635C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504310:1":{"text":"Is that all? You're welcome to them, once my body turns into ashes.","source_cn":"眼睛而已，既然你想要，等我这具身躯归于灰烬时，来取吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF0E7F730A1AFD73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504311:1":{"text":"What? You'd actually let me?","source_cn":"……嗯？你居然答应了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59B14FE0A00FA0CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504312:1":{"text":"I'm just glad to see you so energetic.","source_cn":"总之，看到你依然这么有活力，我就放心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C644CE3B790E575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504313:1":{"text":"...?","source_cn":"……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C15B5912CAA4C17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504314:1":{"text":"Stop acting all sisterly, you twisted corpse!","source_cn":"疯婆子，不要在我面前摆姐姐的架子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46268C7475AA8C61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504315:1":{"text":"It's been far too long since I've had a good bloodbath. How 'bout I use you as my next victim?","source_cn":"我的斧子很久没沾血了，你想尝尝吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55174E8513D942F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041504316:1":{"text":"Keep in mind, I'm not too shabby with a bow myself.","source_cn":"我的箭准头也很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F2317D634464AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504317:1":{"text":"Perfect!","source_cn":"哈哈哈，那就来打一架吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x402E9D099AEEB23B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504318:1":{"text":"I've been dying to smash that calm face of yours into pieces!","source_cn":"我想揍你很久了！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC19107D30C77FF67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:波妮":{"text":"Bonnie","source":"波妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"Nara","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}